lines:
Hm? You’re {0100:0}!
You saved my darling Peeko!{be00}
We owe so much to you!{be01}
What’s that?
You want to sail with me?{be01}
Hmhm...{be01}
You have a Letter bound for Dewford
and a package for Slateport, then?{be01}
Quite the busy life you must lead!{be01}
But, certainly, what you’re asking is
no problem at all.{be01}
You’ve come to the right man!
We’ll set sail for Dewford.
